      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "text": "Added new Admin API capabilities for managing spend alerts, model allowlists, data retention settings, and hosted tool permissions, plus querying granular billing line items.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1780567870938-3",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "text": "Released Secure MCP Tunnel for enterprise customers. Secure MCP Tunnel lets supported OpenAI products including ChatGPT web, Codex, Responses API, and AgentKit connect to private or on-prem MCP servers through a customer-hosted tunnel-client without exposing those servers to the public internet.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1780567870939-4",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "text": "Deprecated DALL·E model snapshots and the Realtime API Beta.",
      "severity": "high",
      "severityLabel": "Breaking / Rimozione",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1780567870939-5",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "text": "DALL·E model snapshots dall-e-2 and dall-e-3 were deprecated and removed from the API on May 12, 2026. We recommend using gpt-image-2, gpt-image-1, or gpt-image-1-mini instead.",
      "severity": "high",
      "severityLabel": "Breaking / Rimozione",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1780567870939-6",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "text": "The Realtime API Beta was deprecated and removed from the API on May 12, 2026. If you are still using the beta interface, migrate to the released Realtime API. See the migration guide and the full deprecations page.",
      "severity": "high",
      "severityLabel": "Breaking / Rimozione",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
